|lead='''I Have You Now''' is a [[Dark]] [[Interrupt]] released as a very-rare foil in [[Reflections III]] in October 2001.<ref name="checklist">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Complete Card List v4.0], pp. 28–32 (collecting compilation). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261009184033/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Internet Archive].</ref><ref name="encyc">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2], Reflections product entry (collecting reference). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261008192828/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf Internet Archive].</ref> It is a foil printing of the [[Premiere]] card.<ref name="foil-face">[[:File:Reflections-III-Foil-D-I-Have-You-Now-SWCA-photo-68374-original.jpg|Original printed Reflections III foil face]], Duncan Jenkins, Star Wars Collectors Archive.</ref>
|lore=“Several fighters have broken off from the main group. Come with me.” Darth Vader targets his TIE fighter’s fire-linked blaster cannons at the Rebel pilots in the trench.<ref name="foil-face" />
|game_text=If a Dark Jedi and a Rebel with ability &gt; 2 are involved in the same battle, you may add one battle destiny (add two destiny if Rebel is Luke).<ref name="foil-face" />
